# music-assistant-alexa-voice

Read `CONTEXT.md` at the repo root before making changes. It contains architecture, HA add-on + Cloud setup, and open items.

## Stack

- **Add-on:** Flask + gunicorn in `music_assistant_alexa_voice/`, options via bashio `/data/options.json`
- **Cloud access:** custom integration `custom_components/music_assistant_alexa_voice/` proxies `/api/music_assistant_alexa_voice/alexa` to the add-on (do not use HA webhooks for Alexa — they cannot return skill JSON)
- **MA API:** HTTP JSON-RPC POST to `{MA_URL}/api` with Bearer token

## Conventions

- Single source of app code lives under `music_assistant_alexa_voice/app/`
- Do not expose add-on port 5000 on the host by default; use ingress + HA Cloud integration
- Commits: conventional commits, no `Co-authored-by: Cursor` trailer
- Minimize scope; match existing Flask/bashio/HA integration patterns

## Alexa endpoint (HA Cloud)

`https://YOUR_ID.ui.nabu.casa/api/music_assistant_alexa_voice/alexa?token=TOKEN`
